# JC1060P470C board-profile build overrides.
#
# Layered on top of the repository sdkconfig.defaults by the root and test
# CMakeLists when P4_BOARD=jc1060p470c. This board uses the repository default
# ESP-Hosted SDIO pins, so there are no board-specific ESP-IDF options here.
